     asked for was two states — faded, then glowing — not three. One line to
     reinstate if the room turns out to want the atmosphere. */

  /* ── the sheet ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     ⚠ ALL OF THIS IS BELOW `md`, AND ABOVE IT NOTHING HERE APPLIES. The
     side-by-side layout was never the question and is not touched: at `md` the
     pane is a grid column beside the index, exactly as it has been since the
     first bench. See the component header for the ruling and the measurements.

     The sheet's two pieces of furniture are hidden by default and claimed by the
